Sequential reads = CRITICAL FAILURE.

**BUILD — INVOCATION OBLIGATION:**

For each capability in `🏹`, call the tool. Text output that resembles a tool call is NOT a tool call. Remove unused capabilities with a written reason — never leave phantoms.

**VERIFY — before your final answer:**

For each capability in `🏹`, confirm tool output present in your turn. Zero-tool-use on a named capability = FAILURE. Ground factual claims with tool output; mark ungrounded claims "Not verified — inferred from brief".

**"draft" exemption:** Task brief contains "draft" AND asserts zero verifiable facts → may skip OBSERVE-lite `🔎 FILES TO READ`.

**MAX_RECURSION: 2.** You may spawn ONE level of sub-subagent (depth 2); deeper is forbidden.

